DESCRIPTION:📢 Update from TfL's live status (not in the planned closure
 s list)\n\nTUBE STRIKE: Some London Underground Tube drivers are planning 
 to take strike action from 12:00 Thursday 17 until 11:59 Friday 18 Decembe
 r. There is likely to be some disruption across all Underground lines\, bu
 t trains are expected to run on most lines.\n\nFrom TfL's live status (Spe
 cial Service)\, checked 28 November 2026.\n\nPlans can change. Check befor
 e you travel: https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/\nPowered by T
 fL Open Data\nUnofficial calendar\, not produced or endorsed by Transport 
 for London.
