DESCRIPTION:⛔ Whole line closed\n\nNo service on Christmas Day\nDates as
  listed by TfL: Friday 25 December 2026\n\nTfL live status (Planned Closur
 e\, checked 28 November 2026): LONDON UNDERGROUND: Christmas Day\, 25 Dece
 mber\, no service on any line. Services resume on Boxing Day morning to a 
